    "id": "lh_idiom_bare_doubled_octaves",
    "category": "composer_hand_idiom",
    "hand": "lh",
    "name": "Bare doubled octaves",
    "description": "the bass line in octaves, no chord, marching. The Promenade and the Great Gate open this way. `[G2,G3]q [F2,F3]q [E-2,E-3]h`",
